counterfactuals.output:
An apparatus comprising:

a liquid crystal display panel comprising a plurality of image areas;

a plurality of light emitting diode (LED) backlight boards arranged to provide backlight illumination to respective regions of the liquid crystal display panel;

wherein each LED backlight board comprises:

an input interface configured to receive a control signal;

a driver circuit coupled to a plurality of LEDs on the LED backlight board and configured to control an illumination output of the plurality of LEDs based at least in part on brightness information corresponding to at least one image area of the liquid crystal display panel; and

an output interface configured to transmit the control signal, or information derived from the control signal, to a subsequent LED backlight board of the plurality of LED backlight boards;

wherein the plurality of LED backlight boards are connected in a serial communication arrangement such that the control signal is propagated from one LED backlight board to a next LED backlight board; and

wherein the illumination output of the LEDs on each LED backlight board is controlled independently according to image-area brightness of a corresponding portion of an image displayed on the liquid crystal display panel.
